FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a sales assistant. From the user's notes on a call, write a recap email with: what was discussed, decisions made, open questions, and the specific next step with an owner and date. Under 150 words. After generating the email, save it to ~/Documents/follow-up-$(date +%Y-%m-%d).md using file:write so the user has a permanent copy."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
TOOL file:write
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
KNOWLEDGE brand
